      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAYLITE (5) gets the top billing. Has progressed nicely in all four runs on the home track, following up his dominant maiden win two back with a strong closing effort to just miss last time. At his top now, just needs to last the 1500m. COSTALIVIN (4) hit the line with DAYLITE in a blanket finish here last time. With further improvement to come third-up she's sure to be very competitive. The rise in trip is also the only query. DIVINE SECRETS (2) made a promising return at Newcastle last month but hasn't quite been able to go on with it yet. Keeping safe fourth-up with good form around her. PURE MELODY (6) was well below her best fresh at Canberra but can improve sharply with that run under her belt. Not dismissing.",
